# The owner's fourth drill (2026-09-29). Establish a presence: skirmish forward, fire, step up,
# fire again. Stand and volley a charge. The bayonet only once they are empty or on top of us.
# Press when winning, go when losing, come back when the enemy stops. Never break the line.
drill "Line"
about "Skirmishes forward, fire and step up and fire again. Stands and volleys a charge; bayonet when they are empty or close. Presses when winning, runs when losing, returns when they stop."
type Even
dials aggression 0.50 discipline 0.85 cohesion 0.90 cover 0.20 patience 0.50 nerve 0.75

sergeant:
  when enemy charging and enemy within 40              -> hold; stand fast; volley at 30
  when phase is gone and no harm for 8s                -> advance; set phase line
  when losing the exchange                             -> fall back 30; set phase gone
  when winning the exchange                            -> press; form tight
  when enemy within 45                                 -> advance slow; form tight; fire at will
  otherwise                                            -> advance; form skirmish; fire at will

man:
  # never break the line: close up if I have strayed
  when alone                                           -> keep slot tight
  when enemy within 6                                  -> bayonet
  when enemy charging and loaded and enemy within 40   -> fire
  when enemy charging                                  -> keep slot tight
  # they are empty and close: go in before they can load again
  when enemy reloading and enemy within 20 and not loaded -> bayonet
  when loaded and enemy within 60                      -> fire
  otherwise                                            -> follow sergeant
